ap-year team that may rest veterans in March.","sources":["https://youtu.be/MUbNYdjpUDM?t=166"]},{"field":"mpg","text":"He played 24.1 minutes last season and 28.8 the year before. He starts at center when healthy but comes back from an absence while Horford holds the job, so I use 26.5.","sources":["https://youtu.be/OBwWCxG9SqM?t=1487","https://youtu.be/MUbNYdjpUDM?t=678","stats"]},{"field":"usg","text":"He is the second scoring option on a team without creators, so 26% usage (25.3% to 26.5% in recent seasons) holds. The base shot rate per minute is below his last two seasons, so I raise it 4%.","sources":["https://youtu.be/ZYllcj4o6_A?t=551","stats"]}]}],"base_sources":["espn","fanscout","fantasypros","fantrax","own-stat","yahoo"]}